node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
.tiles-tmp/

# public/tiles/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It was, and that broke deploys: a Cloudflare build from this GitHub repo had
# no imagery to serve and every player got "Map tiles not found". Committing the
# ~7.3 MB of tiles is what makes a git-based deploy work out of the box.
#
# See the README for where the art comes from. If you would rather not host it,
# delete public/tiles/ and re-add it here — the app falls back to the CDN.
